<view class="page mahjong-lobby-page">
  <view class="game-header"><view class="title">麻将房间</view><view class="muted">四人大众麻将 · 满员后由房主开始</view></view>
  <view class="room-purpose-notice" role="note"><text class="room-purpose-title">测试学习交流声明</text><text>本房间仅用于游戏测试、学习与交流；虚拟筹码不具有现金或财产价值，不涉及充值、提现、现金输赢或奖励兑换，请勿用于赌博或其他违法活动。</text></view>
  <view class="mahjong-lobby-table" style="height:{{boardSize}}px">
    <view class="mahjong-lobby-felt"><view class="mahjong-table-title">麻将</view><view>{{playerCount}} / 4 人已入座</view><view class="muted">东家为本局庄家，规则可继续定制</view><button wx:if="{{isHost}}" class="primary-button" disabled="{{playerCount < 4}}" bindtap="onStart">开始牌局</button></view>
    <view wx:for="{{players}}" wx:key="seat" class="mahjong-lobby-seat mahjong-lobby-seat-{{item.seat}} {{item.nickname ? 'occupied' : ''}}">
      <view class="seat-title">{{item.seatLabel}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.nickname}}" class="seat-name">{{item.nickname}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.nickname}}" class="seat-score">{{item.score}} 积分</view><view wx:if="{{item.isHost}}" class="host">房主</view><view wx:if="{{item.nickname && !item.connected}}" class="muted">已断开</view><view wx:if="{{!item.nickname}}" class="muted">空位</view><button wx:if="{{isHost && item.nickname && item.seat !== ownSeat}}" class="danger-button" data-seat="{{item.seat}}" bindtap="onRemove">移除</button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{spectator}}" class="spectator-banner">观战模式 · 等待下一局</view>
  <view wx:if="{{spectators.length}}" class="panel spectator-panel"><view class="section-title">观战席（{{spectators.length}}）</view><view wx:for="{{spectators}}" wx:key="nickname" class="spectator-row">{{item.nickname}}</view></view>
  <view class="panel status-panel"><view>当前人数：{{playerCount}} / 4</view><view wx:if="{{!isHost}}" class="muted hint">等待房主开始</view><button class="leave-button" bindtap="onLeave">退出房间</button></view>
  <room-chat messages="{{chat}}" members="{{chatMembers}}" own-seat="{{ownSeat}}" bind:send="onChatSend" />
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view>
</view>
